<title>USA: Medical Discoveries names Kulas CEO.</title>
<headline>Medical Discoveries names Kulas CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Discoveries Inc said Tuesday that it has named Lee Kulas president and chief executive officer of the company.</p>
<p>Kulas was previously associated with K.K. Adachi (Osaka, Japan) as president and chief executive officer of Adachi's U.S. operations.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was ot available to say who Kulas replaces.</p>
</text>
